      stem="若 $\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\left(x - a_{1}\\cos x - b_{1}\\sin x\\right)^{2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\min_{a,b\\in \\mathbf{R}}\\left\\{\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\left(x - a\\cos x - b\\sin x\\right)^{2}\\mathrm{d}x\\right\\}$ , 则 $a_{1}\\cos x + b_{1}\\sin x = (\\quad)$",
      answer_text="【解】 令 $F(a,b) = \\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}(x - a\\cos x - b\\sin x)^{2}\\mathrm{d}x$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} = \\int_ {- \\pi} ^ {\\pi} \\left(x ^ {2} + a ^ {2} \\cos^ {2} x + b ^ {2} \\sin^ {2} x - 2 a x \\cos x - 2 b x \\sin x + 2 a b \\sin x \\cos x\\right) d x \\\\ = 2 \\int_ {0} ^ {\\pi} \\left(x ^ {2} + a ^ {2} \\cos^ {2} x + b ^ {2} \\sin^ {2} x - 2 b x \\sin x\\right) d x \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} = \\frac {2}{3} \\pi^ {3} + 2 a ^ {2} \\int_ {0} ^ {\\pi} \\cos^ {2} x \\mathrm {d} x + 2 b ^ {2} \\int_ {0} ^ {\\pi} \\sin^ {2} x \\mathrm {d} x - 4 b \\int_ {0} ^ {\\pi} x \\sin x \\mathrm {d} x \\\\ = \\frac {2}{3} \\pi^ {3} + 4 a ^ {2} \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} \\cos^ {2} x d x + 4 b ^ {2} \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} \\sin^ {2} x d x - 4 b \\cdot \\frac {\\pi}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {\\pi} \\sin x d x \\\\ = \\frac {2}{3} \\pi^ {3} + \\pi a ^ {2} + \\pi b ^ {2} - 4 \\pi b, \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n由 $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} F_{a}^{\\prime} = 2\\pi a = 0, \\\\ F_{b}^{\\prime} = 2\\pi b - 4\\pi = 0 \\end{array} \\right.$ 得 $a = 0, b = 2$\n\n$$\nA = F _ {a a} ^ {\\prime \\prime} = 2 \\pi , \\quad B = F _ {a b} ^ {\\prime \\prime} = 0, \\quad C = F _ {b b} ^ {\\prime \\prime} = 2 \\pi ,\n$$\n\n由 $AC - B^2 = 4\\pi^2 >0$ 且 $A > 0$ 得 $a = 0,b = 2$ 时， $F(a,b)$ 取最小值，故 $a_1 = 0,b_1 = 2$ 应选(A).",
